        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Don-Jo 15-S-CW,  Wrap Around Plate for KABA 1000 Series Push Button Locks</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nDoor Security wrap around plate for use with KABA Simplex 1000 Series mechanical locks. Protects door from tampering or prying.  Satin Stainless steel finish.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nUsed to convert existing door to use a KABA Simplex 1000 series push button lock. For use with <a href=\"/products/simplex-keypad-entry-lock-kaba-1011\">KABA 1011</a>, <a href=\"/products/simplex-keypad-entry-lock-with-key-override-kaba-1021\">KABA 1021</a>, <a href=\"/products/simplex-keypad-entry-lock-with-passage-feature-kaba-1031\">KABA 1031</a>, <a href=\"/products/simplex-keypad-entry-lock-with-passage-feature-and-key-override-kaba-1041\">KABA 1041</a>, <a href=\"/products/simplex-keypad-entry-lever-lock-kaba-l1011\">KABA L1011</a>,  <a href=\"/products/simplex-keypad-entry-lever-lock-with-key-override-kaba-l1021\">KABA L1021</a>,  <a href=\"/products/simplex-keypad-entry-lever-lock-with-passage-feature-kaba-l1031\">KABA L1031</a>, <a href=\"/products/simplex-keypad-entry-lever-lock-with-passage-feature-and-key-override-kaba-l1041\">KABA L1041</a> and <a href=\"/products/simplex-keypad-entry-lever-lock-with-privacy-feature-and-key-override-kaba-l1076\">KABA L1076</a>.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Don-Jo 15-S-CW KABA Lock Installation Plate:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Gauge: 22 (.032\")</li>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 5-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 15\"</li>\r\n<li>Finish: Satin Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DJO-15CW-specifcations.pdf?v=1704262304\" target=\"new\"><b>Don-Jo 15-CW Specification (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
